        { "type": "caption", "fa": "چهلم · آذر ۱۴۰۱", "en": "THE FORTIETH DAY · AZAR 1401", "de": "DER VIERZIGSTE TAG · AZAR 1401" },
        { "type": "silence", "seconds": 4.0 },
        { "type": "camera", "mark": "Wide", "blend": 3.0 },
        { "type": "text", "who": "relative", "fa": "نصفِ بچه‌های دانشگاهشون تو کوچه ایستادن. جا نبود بیان بالا.", "en": "Half the students from his university are standing down in the alley. There wasn't room for them all upstairs.", "de": "Die Hälfte der Studierenden seiner Uni steht unten in der Gasse. Oben war kein Platz mehr für alle." },
        { "type": "camera", "mark": "Faces", "blend": 2.5 },
        { "type": "text", "who": "friend", "fa": "ویدیوهایی که گرفته بود… همه‌جا پخش شده. با چشم‌های اون دارن می‌بینن.", "en": "The videos he filmed… they're everywhere now. People are seeing through his eyes.", "de": "Die Videos, die er gefilmt hat… sie sind jetzt überall. Die Menschen sehen durch seine Augen." },
        { "type": "text", "who": "sister", "fa": "دیگه هیچ‌وقت روسری سرم نمی‌کنم. قول دادم بهش.", "en": "I will never wear that scarf again. I promised him.", "de": "Ich werde dieses Kopftuch nie wieder tragen. Ich habe es ihm versprochen." },
        { "type": "hide_text" },
        { "type": "silence", "seconds": 3.0 },
        { "type": "fade", "to": 1, "time": 3.5 },
        { "type": "silence", "seconds": 1.5 }
      ]
    },
